{"id":"c5085dd84d7b744a","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-external-consistency.md","title":"元理论一致性","display":"df-external-consistency — 元理论一致性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-external-consistency","aliases":["91-df-external-consistency"],"display":"df-external-consistency — 元理论一致性","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-theory]]","[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-external-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-external-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-external-consistency — 元理论一致性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"024b320d234d188f\" href=\"?note=024b320d234d188f\" title=\"91-df-truth-theory\">91-df-truth-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e50c115b0d32044\" href=\"?note=4e50c115b0d32044\" title=\"91-df-consistency-predicate\">91-df-consistency-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-external-consistency-—-元理论一致性-$\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{ext}}$\">df-external-consistency — 元理论一致性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{ext}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{ext}}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (可递归公理化理论)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> (标准自然数结构)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的标准一致性句)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_S\\)</span> (固定证明编码下的标准可证性谓词)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{ext}}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{ext}}(S)\\)</span> 是下述定义的元层一致性性质缩写，参数为理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ext}\">\\(\\mathrm{ext}\\)</span> 为标准模型满足层级的下标。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}external\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{ext}}(S)\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathbb N\\models\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Con}(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}external\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{ext}}(S)\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathbb N\\models\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Con}(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>该定义在元层断言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 没有形式矛盾。它不指定哪个形式理论能够证明\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\)</span>。若要表达后一性质，必须另写\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(S)\">\\(B\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\)</span> 并标明背景理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>因此下列概念不可互换：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>形式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>外部一致性</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Con}(S)\">\\(\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 中可证的一致性</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(S)\">\\(B\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相对一致性</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(U)\\to\\mathrm{Con}(S)\">\\(B\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(U)\\to\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>模型构造或解释通常建立外部/相对一致性。即使 TB、UTB 对 PA 保守，\n也不能据此断言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{TB})\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{TB})\\)</span>：\n由于它们包含 PA，这样的无条件证明还会推出\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>，与第二不完备定理冲突。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-external-consistency-—-元理论一致性-$\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{ext}}$","text":"df-external-consistency — 元理论一致性 $\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{ext}}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-theory","status":"resolved","id":"024b320d234d188f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-consistency-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"4e50c115b0d32044","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{ext}}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{ext}}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ext}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}external\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{ext}}(S)\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathbb N\\models\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Con}(S).","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"B\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Con}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"B\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"B\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(U)\\to\\mathrm{Con}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{TB})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false}],"bytes":1755,"backlinks":[{"id":"fb5e07d472a8bf03","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-external-consistency]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.